Third-party data and components

Map data is retrieved at runtime from the OpenStreetMap Overpass API.
OpenStreetMap data is © OpenStreetMap contributors and is licensed under
the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0, which is separate from and not
superseded by this program's licence. See
<https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright>.

Downloaded map tiles under data/maps/ are therefore ODbL data, not part
of this program's source, and the same applies to the recorded district
bundled at data/fixtures/real_network.osm.xml, and each carries a .manifest.json recording its
source, licence, query and checksum.

Eclipse SUMO is used as an optional external batch-validation tool and is
licensed separately under EPL-2.0.
